_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","review_id":"sdUa0ZTNTFACWZiyAjMhxw","date":"2017-04-03T23:43:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9525608420372009,"text_excerpt":"Was a customer of Little Tokyo till the quality when down. On visiting Ikura I was glad to see a Host and have the option for Hibachi dining again! I enjoyed the Sushi bar and was allowed to taste one of the new creations a Surf and Turf roll--a shrimp and crab roll wrapped in thin slices of steak and it was spectacular I am unsure if it's on the menu you have to ask for it. I also recommend The Tropical roll which was amazing!"},{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","review_id":"nRkB7spjkGtLbBArnJLqaQ","date":"2017-06-06T18:32:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9459630846977234,"text_excerpt":"I was a huge fan of the Little Tokyo location that used to be here and it seems like Ikura is just as good, if not a little bit better. I stopped in for a really early dinner and, even though I was eating alone, I wasn't forced to sit at the sushi bar- already a win. I decided to keep it simple with my usual Philly Roll and Tuna Roll and I got their Big 'n Easy roll which had all kinds of yummy raw stuff in it. The Philly and Tuna rolls were perfection. The Big 'n Easy roll was great, the fish was fresh and it was really big and well worth the price. Of course, I had leftovers that I was happy to box up and enjoy later. One thing that blew me away was how fast the service was here. There ..."},{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","review_id":"DzwFbQhgNJnXOwTh-ioisQ","date":"2020-10-09T03:03:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9419823884963989,"text_excerpt":"This spot is open kind of late for a restaurant, which was a blessing when I was hungry for a late night bite! I ALMOST ordered the ramen, but read a previous review that showed a really questionable ramen and stuck with sushi instead. The sushi selections are vast and there is a LOT to choose from, all appropriately priced. For this order, I got the Bourbon Roll, Metairie Roll, & Squid Steak. I'm not the biggest squid steak connoisoeur but my partner enjoyed it. we ordered to-go and they gave us some of the extra sauce on the side. The Bourbon Roll was fried to perfection and sooo delicious. The Metairie roll was basic but good, and the fish tasted fresh. Overall, will return and def rec..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","photo_id":"mBNhxhCEOKZYDUV1ctFcLw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/mBNhxhCEOKZYDUV1ctFcLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8799886703491211},{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","photo_id":"9DCiiBcy9Bq2pa1a4wzxoQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9DCiiBcy9Bq2pa1a4wzxoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.820275068283081},{"business_id":"V30n7ngQ35CD9Il1dNkDhA","photo_id":"kyvE0sbfzJ_x3P6iUN7ZnQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kyvE0sbfzJ_x3P6iUN7ZnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7898184061050415}]},"notebook_case":null}
